    "現地確認": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Field Check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面が消えると受信が止まります。VoiceOver の画面カーテンを使うと、画面を暗くしたまま受信を続けられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reception stops when the screen turns off. With VoiceOver’s Screen Curtain, the screen stays dark while reception continues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面を閉じたり、ほかのアプリに切り替えたりすると受信できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is received while the screen is off or another app is in front."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面を閉じている間は受信できません。表示を続けてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is received while the screen is off or the app is in the background. Keep Aoshingo on screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "番号は信号データ内の並び順です。どの横断歩道の信号かはまだ確認できていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Numbers are the order within the signal data. Which crossing each number belongs to has not been confirmed yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "白黒と形だけで表示します。青は白地、赤は黒地です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Black, white and shapes only. Green is white, red is black."
          }
        }
      }
    },
